_liveedit_tagid="000000001C791180"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13F80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D76C0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C118DD0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281960"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281BA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27B7D0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13AC0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C113230"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0CA5B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C113950"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F950" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F6F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F490" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F230"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49C450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your time earlier. It was great getting to know you and learning more about your business. As promised, I'm sharing further information regarding the benefits of your Qantas Business Rewards membership and how you can extract the most value for your business.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2DD0D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2DCD60"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49A130">I appreciate you raising XXX during our call. I have looked into this for you and found XXX</mark>. If you require further assistance with this, please let me know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2DCB20"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C266280">Some helpful links are listed below which we recommend saving for quick and easy navigation:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C1151B0" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C1179B0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78D950" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Qantas Business Rewards Account</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78EE70" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C285630" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards flying benefits</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29BF10" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/manage-travel/travel-fund.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281700" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Get familiar with Travel Fund</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0AFC30" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/qantas-club" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A497CB0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78F8A0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/save-on-qantas-club.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD91C10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27BDC0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27FCE0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn points on business expenses through our 50+ partners</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A493AC0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27FBB0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to make the most out of the stored traveller feature</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2D7EA0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281240" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards How-To Guides</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A493E50" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C110CA0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards FAQs</font></a></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2657F0">As we covered in our call, below is an overview of the key benefits available to your business through Qantas Business Rewards:</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11A090"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11AB00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A495010"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78BAD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0FAA0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE05870"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D0680" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29E2B0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C28A0A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B41B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-flights.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2619D0" 