nto every booking to earn points twice, for the business and the traveller!</font></em></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD89180"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFED60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFBCC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD885A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD88800"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE04E10"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFEC30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF6AB0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD9FBF0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFFC20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE000A0" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C4CE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C3530"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4F2480" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C25E0A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C285D50"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4934D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C786190">Earn Qantas Points</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE03B10">Earn points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A490EF0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>. As a Level 2 member, you can earn 30 Qantas Points for your business for every 100 points your flyers earn. Plus, book a hotel through your&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A496C30">Business Account</strong>&nbsp;and earn even more - up to 6 points per $1 spent (3 points for the business, and 3 points for the Frequent Flyer.)</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A490350"></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D4580"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C1105C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0DB50"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C10F0E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C787460"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4996D0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDB83A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C10F470"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C28AC80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0CECC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/graph-up-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE03EA0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2D1550" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE04490"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CB2F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C4A80"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD65B0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8C660" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C5AA0">Fast track your level progression</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDE620">Unlock bigger rewards and savings sooner with the ability to count points across your entire trip towards your membership level, from car hire and Qantas Hotels bookings to eligible Qantas and Jetstar flights. Remember, by earning 80,000 business Qantas Points your business can reach Level 3 and access more benefits.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EC590"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8DF30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDC760"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B6840" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C25D060"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78E070"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8D6E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C792450"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C78E750"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE10FA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDE1A40" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7913E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C112A10"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C4820" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8C1C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C789ED0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CB090" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2DAEE0">Business travel</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B8820">Easily book and manage flights, hotels and car hire directly from your Business Account, along with creating and managing your business’ travel policy. Plus, enjoy access to real time reporting and analytics to track your travel spend and easily download expense reports.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2DB380"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD9A8A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD88340"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD7650" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C6C20"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2AB530"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8F670" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE132A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE11790"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7883C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/wallet-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B9AF0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C284A50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B9C00"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C111AD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C1113B0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDAC50"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C788AC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F360">Access Travel Fund</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B7D90">Travel Fund allows you to store and combine the value from flights you need to cancel or change, in your Business Account. Use it instantly as a payment option, for anyone in your business, on any eligible flight.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F820"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDC0F50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD92640"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C87A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C786FA0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A9C40"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A48FAE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C9F40"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7948E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C26A450" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-reporting-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B5B90" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDB8600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A4FA0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B6D00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE01050"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2814A0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B7680" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE14690">Access real-time reporting and analytics</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D0ED0">Gain valuable insights into your team’s booking behaviour and track your travel spend, policy compliance and easily download expense reports.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27FF40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C282F40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F5C0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE141E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B2B50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EB900"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27F100" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4F6ED0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C9950"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B78E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/classic-flight-rewards-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11B220" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B2430" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C788880"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE148F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE05C00"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD6A70"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4F11C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD83870">Reduce travel costs</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDD790">Redeem your business's Qantas Points on flights, upgrades, seats and bags directly from your Business Account.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D4A40" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">±</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7934C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDA8C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C119030"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C1158D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D7460"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D8E70"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD8EF50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C114F50"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27E0A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EED50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/lounge-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDC060" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EDAE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD64A0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD946A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD940D0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27EDB0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CB420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27E430">Unlock lounge access</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11BC80">Save up to 30% off Qantas Club memberships^ for you and your travellers.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CBA10"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27E300" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2C5000"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2887F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CAF60"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EE1B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27D390" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4ED3C0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2D9860"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4EDD40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/flyer-bonus-icon.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11AFA0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A490900" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE001B0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C284220" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A9EA0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C282710"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281DE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0CEA60">Flyer bonus</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C4130">250 bonus Qantas Points per booking for Frequent Flyers<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27E560" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">+</sup>, every time they fly for work, on top of the points and Status Credits they already earn.<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2824B0" style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11C280"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFC490" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C3DC0"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8BCD00" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49ACD0"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49B870"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C11D7B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have a query, please feel free to contact me by calling 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85, or you can speak to the Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13&nbsp;74&nbsp;78. I look forward to speaking with you again soon.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49CB60"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B5110">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE120F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF7AC0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0C9E90">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF79B0">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D6FC0">Qantas Business Rewards</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C1CE0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A491AB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C288A50"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D0420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B21D0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49BF90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/images/why-fly-qantas-24.png" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D6EB0" style="width: 600px; display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A6210"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49D260" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2D18E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2CF0C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 12px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. Selected featured content may not be available on your flight. Inflight entertainment varies by route and aircraft.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D5BE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D5150">2. Meals, beverages, entertainment offerings vary between flight times. Alcohol offered during select flight times on select flights.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D1330"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0F030">3. Qantas Club membership and access is subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club/terms-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49A390" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;of the Qantas Club.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0EF20"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0CF170">4. The number of destinations is correct as at 5 February 2024, but is subject to change.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDB3770"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0D6A0">5. You must be a member of the Qantas Frequent Flyer program to earn and redeem Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the Qantas Frequent Flyer program terms and conditions.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A49C1F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C0D5850" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4915F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A491850" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C287620"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A492DB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A497480" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A48F050"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29FCC0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A499A20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29DA60" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B9EA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A48ED00"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A39B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A4921D0"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A66D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C23E0" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDF690"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A493010"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C288200" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A48F180" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/facebook.png" title="Facebook" width="40" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0EA80"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/Qantas" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C28A300" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/twitter.png" title="Twitter" width="43" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C281F10"></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/qantas/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C28A560" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/instagram.png" title="Instagram" width="51" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0FBD0"></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/Qantas" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" height="22" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/youtube.png" title="Youtube" width="49" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0FE10"></a></font></td><td align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C10E040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: right; width: 214px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A491D10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" height="33" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QF-oneworld-logo-lockup.png" title="Qantas" width="166" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE10810"></font></a></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8BE6E0"><td align="center" colspan="2" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A499340" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><hr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE10920" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C15C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDE2E40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B76A0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A4790"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29BCB0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0AE630" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B7DC0" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A7E30"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29DCC0"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C00A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; font-family: Ciutadella, Arial !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE10A30"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDF1D0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/contactus" target="_blank" title="Contact Us" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDED10" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Contact Us</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" title="Program Terms" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDCFB0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Program Terms</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/privacy/global/en" target="_blank" title="Privacy Statement" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0AFE90" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Privacy Statement</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/help/global/en" title="Online Help" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFBA70" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Online Help</a></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A8C50"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFB940" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFD2C0"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A7840" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To unsubscribe from Qantas marketing offers, contact your Account Manager&nbsp;<a href="mailto:?subject=Unsubscribe%20from%20Qantas%20marketing%20offers" target="_blank" title="Unsubscribe" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDF430" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">here</a>&nbsp;to unsubscribe.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD5D80"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B8BD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27C4A0" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B7900"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8BDFC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDE24F0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8B8020"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE00F20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFFAF0" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFD9B0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE02420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 14px; height: 14px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFB040"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFEE90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 14px; height: 14px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFEFC0"><td class="height_five" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF9B20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 5px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 5px; height: 5px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE021C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF61A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A7160" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A4530"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFA480" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE0E490" style="margin: 0px 40px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF8A80"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFCF30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. A one-off joining fee of $89.50 usually applies, is inclusive of any applicable GST and may be varied by Qantas from time to time, without notice, in its absolute discretion. Membership and Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD66E0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points for business are offered under the Qantas Hotels Terms and Conditions. Qantas Business Rewards Members will earn 3 Qantas Point per $1 spent for their business on eligible Qantas Hotels booked online through their Business Account only, or earn 1 Qantas Point per $1 spent for their business on all other eligible domestic and international Qantas Hotels accommodation only (room rate) and paid for in the booking excluding Airbnb bookings. Members will not be able to earn points on additional charges paid to the accommodation provider for extras (including cots, breakfasts and other incidentals) on check-in or check-out (as applicable). Qantas Points will be credited to the Members' Business Rewards Account within 9 weeks after check-out, the additional points earned from booking via the Business Account will be awarded separately up to 11 weeks after check-out. The traveller must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn points as a Frequent Flyer.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD6940"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE02550" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFB170"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFD060" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"># You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF5140" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html#eligibleflights" target="_blank" title="Eligile Flights" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFCA50" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">eligible flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF56F0">one</strong>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html#eligibleflights" target="_blank" title="Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE13E50" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/airline-earn-table.html" target="_blank" title="Airline Earning Tables" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C2A81C0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for details on the conditions for the applicable airline.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8BAFB0"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8C0300" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFD3F0"><td class="t_c" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDDF8F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">± A business can redeem Qantas Points directly from their Qantas Business Rewards account on Classic Flight Rewards or Points Plus Pay flights and/or transfer Qantas Points out of the Qantas Business Rewards accounts into any individual’s Qantas Frequent Flyer account. In order to transfer or directly redeem Qantas Points from a Qantas Business Rewards account, the business account must have a balance of at least 3,000 Qantas Points. You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn, transfer and redeem Qantas Points as an individual. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFC180" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. We recommend you consult your accountant or tax adviser to ensure you understand possible tax implications, for example fringe benefits tax (if applicable).<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C27C260"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD9C040">~ Savings are available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards Members on the base fare of selected fares only and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Member Deals are subject to the Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD9C280"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BD9C5F0">^ Discounted Qantas Club membership is available to Qantas Frequent Flyer members who are Qantas Business Rewards Flyers of the Qantas Business Rewards Member. The discount applies to Qantas Club Individual membership rates and is managed under the Qantas Club Qantas Business Rewards scheme. Qantas Club membership is subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club/terms-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BE022F0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Club Terms and Conditions</a>. Please be advised that lounges are subject to capacity limits at the time of your visit. If you're flying domestically on Qantas, QantasLink or Jetstar within Australia, and on Jetstar within New Zealand you may bring one guest to join you in a Qantas Club lounge. When visiting an international Qantas Club lounge, you are able to invite one guest each time you visit. Both you and your guest need to be travelling together further that day on the same flight.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/airport-lounges/qantas-lounge-access-eligibility.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFC5C0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Lounge access eligibility</a>&nbsp;conditions apply.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C26A7E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDD56C0">+ You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and points are subject to the Qantas Frequent Flyer program&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/terms-and-conditions.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFF9C0" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>. Qantas Frequent Flyers will earn 250 Qantas Points per eligible flight booking where a Qantas Business Rewards Member's ABN and the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number are quoted at the time of booking. An eligible booking must include a domestic or international flight with a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards. Points will be credited to the Frequent Flyers account within 6 weeks from the date of travel. Points cannot be withdrawn from members' account once credited if the booking is changed or cancelled. No retrospective claims can be made for this offer.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0B1880"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C29D0E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDF81A0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BDFF890" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>